        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 461222, Two Piece Entry Door Handleset with San Carlos Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Two Piece San Carlos Wrought Steel Handleset looks fit to grace the door of any old world castle and will be sure to bring that rustic glamor to your front door as well. This Two Piece Entry Door Handleset with San Carlos Grip is made out of wrought steel and is available in satin steel and flack black steel finishes. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-5/8 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from your favorite historic interior trim knob or lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the San Carlos Wrought Steel Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Two Piece Entrance Handleset with San Carlos Grip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height:3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-3/4\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-460222-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek 461222 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-D-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262356\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Two Piece San Carlos Wrought Steel Handleset",
                "description": "The Two Piece San Carlos Wrought Steel Handleset looks fit to grace the door of any old world castle and will be sure to bring that rustic glamor to your front door as well. This Two Piece Entry Door Handleset with San Carlos Grip is made out of wrought steel and is available in satin steel and flack black steel finishes. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-5/8 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from your favorite historic interior trim knob or lever.",
